  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>One way or another, you aren't quite in your time. You could be a stranded time traveler, or just a person who fits more with the ideals and customs of a time long before or after the one in which you currently reside. Either way, though this time is not your own, you still fight to protect it.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Qualities</div><p>Assign a d10 and a d8 to two of these qualities:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.JzAMmM18LkxtTJqA]{History}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.brt7V1SXffIWpPTl]{Magical Lore}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.qualities.Item.8sdeTQgqsZuFExgc]{Technology}</p><p>• Select from Physical qualities category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Principle</div><p>Choose an Esoteric principle.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Power Source</div><p>Roll d10, d8, d6 for power source selection.</p></section>"
